    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54502" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ-ᾰμελέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>give no heed to</i>, c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁδοιπορίης, ἐδωδῆς</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
